==English==

===Adverb===
'''[[in]] [[cold]] [[blood]]'''

# {{idiom}} In a [[ruthless]] and [[unfeeling]] manner; [[premeditated]] and [[deliberate]].
#: ''It was not a suicide!  He was murdered '''in cold blood'''.''

